{"sha": "e12f44bf2d8c9eb98cb18777121067572f9d5a8cb089611b77fd08ff9288024f", "body": ["\\textbf{4.} 令 $g(w) = 1/h(1/w)$：当 $\\abs w > 1$ 时，$1/w \\in", "\\mathbb D\\setminus\\{0\\}$，且此处 $h \\neq 0$：良定义，", "单射（单射的复合），展开式为", "\\[", "g(w) = \\frac{1}{\\frac1w\\bigl(1 + \\frac{a_2}{2w^2} +", "\\cdots\\bigr)} = w\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{a_2}{2w^2} + \\cdots\\Bigr)", "= w - \\frac{a_2}{2}\\,w^{-1} + \\cdots :", "\\]", "此为第一部分的形式，其中 $b_1 = -\\frac{a_2}2$。面积定理", "给出 $\\abs{\\frac{a_2}2} \\leq 1$，即 $\\abs{a_2} \\leq 2$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $k(z) = \\frac z{(1-z)^2} = z\\sum_{m\\geq0}(m +", "1)z^m = \\sum_{n\\geq1}nz^n$：系数为 $a_n = n$，故 $a_2 =", "2$。单叶性与像：$k = \\frac14\\bigl[w^2 - 1\\bigr]$", "其中 $w = \\frac{1 + z}{1 - z}$，将 $\\mathbb D$", "共形映为右半平面；$w^2$ 将该半平面", "共形映为 $\\C\\setminus\\intoc{-\\infty}0$；再经", "$\\frac{\\cdot - 1}4$ 得", "$\\C\\setminus\\intoc{-\\infty}{-\\frac14}$：每一步均单射，", "像如所述。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 令 $F = \\frac{cf}{c - f}$。因 $c \\notin f(\\mathbb", "D)$，分母处处不为零，故 $F$ 全纯，并且", "单射（$w \\mapsto \\frac{cw}{c - w}$ 为莫比乌斯变换，", "在 $w = c$ 之外单射）。展开时取 $f = z + a_2z^2 + \\cdots$，", "\\[", "F = f\\cdot\\frac1{1 - f/c} = \\bigl(z + a_2z^2\\bigr)\\Bigl(1 +", "\\frac zc\\Bigr) + O(z^3)", "= z + \\Bigl(a_2 + \\frac1c\\Bigr)z^2 + O(z^3):", "\\]", "$F \\in \\mathcal S$，且 $A_2 = a_2 + \\frac1c$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 两次应用比伯巴赫定理：$\\abs{a_2} \\leq 2$ 且", "$\\abs{a_2 + \\frac1c} \\leq 2$，故 $\\abs{\\frac1c} \\leq 4$：", "$\\abs c \\geq \\frac14$。不被取到的每个值都位于", "$D(0,\\frac14)$ 之外，即 $f(\\mathbb D) \\supseteq D(0, \\frac14)$。", "此界为最优：科贝函数不取 $-\\frac14$（第 5 题）。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 设 $d = d(z_0, \\partial\\Omega)$，并令 $\\psi =", "\\varphi^{-1} \\colon \\mathbb D \\to \\Omega$, $\\psi(0) = z_0$,", "$\\psi'(0) = 1/\\varphi'(z_0) > 0$。归一化 $\\tilde", "f(z) = \\frac{\\psi(z) - z_0}{\\psi'(0)}$ 属于 $\\mathcal S$，", "故其像包含 $D(0, \\frac14)$；还原尺度后，", "$\\Omega = \\psi(\\mathbb D) \\supseteq D\\bigl(z_0,", "\\tfrac{\\psi'(0)}4\\bigr)$，故 $d \\geq \\frac{\\psi'(0)}4 =", "\\frac1{4\\varphi'(z_0)}$：左侧不等式。右侧：$\\varphi\\circ(z_0 + d\\,\\cdot)$", "将 $\\mathbb D$ 映入 $\\mathbb D$，且 $0 \\mapsto 0$；施瓦茨引理", "给出其在 $0$ 处的导数界：$d\\,\\varphi'(z_0) \\leq 1$，即", "$\\frac1{\\varphi'(z_0)} \\geq d$ --- 合并得", "\\[", "d \\leq \\frac1{\\varphi'(z_0)} \\leq 4d .", "\\]", "（题中所示左侧不等式就是上述链式", "重新整理后的形式。）", "", "\\textbf{9.} 对科贝函数 $a_n = n$：", "猜想中处处取等；其旋转", "$\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}k(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}z) = \\sum", "n\\eu^{\\iu(n-1)\\theta}z^n$ 亦有 $\\abs{a_n} = n$。沿用", "第 4 题的思路：$h = z + \\frac{a_2}2z^3 + c_5z^5 + \\cdots$，且满足", "$h^2 = f(z^2)$；比较 $z^6$ 的系数：$2c_5 +", "\\frac{a_2^2}4 = a_3$，故 $c_5 = \\frac{a_3}2 -", "\\frac{a_2^2}8$。于是", "\\[", "g(w) = \\frac1{h(1/w)} = w\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{a_2}{2w^2} +", "\\Bigl(\\frac{a_2^2}4 - c_5\\Bigr)\\frac1{w^4} + \\cdots\\Bigr)", "= w - \\frac{a_2}2w^{-1} + \\Bigl(\\frac{3a_2^2}8 -", "\\frac{a_3}2\\Bigr)w^{-3} + \\cdots,", "\\]", "于是由面积定理（$\\sum n\\abs{b_n}^2 \\leq 1$）得", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\frac{a_2}2\\Bigr|^2 + 3\\,\\Bigl|\\frac{3a_2^2}8 -", "\\frac{a_3}2\\Bigr|^2 \\leq 1 .", "\\]", "科贝函数检验（$a_2 = 2$，$a_3 = 3$）：$\\abs{\\frac{a_2}2}^2 = 1$", "且 $\\frac{3\\cdot4}8 - \\frac32 = 0$，总和恰为 $1$ ---", "取极值，理应如此。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\varphi$ 为圆盘自同构，且", "$\\varphi(0) = z_0$，故 $f\\circ\\varphi$ 在", "$\\mathbb D$ 上单叶（单射的复合），且 $f'(z_0) \\neq", "0$（见\\cref{def:b3:conformal:conformal}）：$F$ 良定义", "且单叶。$F(0) = 0$。由商的求导法则：", "\\[", "\\varphi'(z) = \\frac{(1 + \\bar z_0z) - (z + z_0)\\bar z_0}", "{(1 + \\bar z_0z)^2}", "= \\frac{1 - \\abs{z_0}^2}{(1 + \\bar z_0z)^2},", "\\qquad \\varphi'(0) = 1 - \\abs{z_0}^2 ,", "\\]", "故 $(f\\circ\\varphi)'(0) = f'(z_0)(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2)$，且", "$F'(0) = 1$，故 $F \\in \\mathcal S$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 记 $G = f\\circ\\varphi$，则 $G'' =", "f''(\\varphi)\\,\\varphi'^2 + f'(\\varphi)\\,\\varphi''$，且", "$\\varphi''(z) = -2\\bar z_0(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2)(1 + \\bar", "z_0z)^{-3}$ 给出 $\\varphi''(0) = -2\\bar z_0(1 -", "\\abs{z_0}^2)$。因此", "\\[", "A_2 = \\frac{G''(0)}{2f'(z_0)(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2)}", "= \\frac12\\Bigl[\\bigl(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2\\bigr)", "\\frac{f''(z_0)}{f'(z_0)} - 2\\bar z_0\\Bigr] .", "\\]", "对 $F$ 应用比伯巴赫（第 4 题）：$\\abs{A_2} \\leq 2$，即", "$\\bigl|(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2)\\frac{f''(z_0)}{f'(z_0)} - 2\\bar", "z_0\\bigr| \\leq 4$。两边同乘", "$z_0/(1 - \\abs{z_0}^2)$，其模为", "$r/(1 - r^2)$，其中 $z_0 = r\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，并利用 $z_0\\bar", "z_0 = r^2$：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\,z_0\\frac{f''(z_0)}{f'(z_0)} -", "\\frac{2r^2}{1 - r^2}\\Bigr| \\leq \\frac{4r}{1 - r^2} .", "\\]", ""]}